 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Finite presentation descends over a unit-ideal localization span",
 "statement": "Let $R$ be a commutative ring, $N$ an $R$-module, and $s\\subset R$ a set with $\\operatorname{Ideal.span}(s)=\\top$. If $N_f$ is finitely presented over $R_f$ for every $f\\in s$, then $N$ is finitely presented over $R$ [def-sc-finitely-presented-module].",
